6/5/2026-

I started this a few days ago, just because it sounded like a fun
idea and something that I personally will use, as well as other people
that I know personally.

I've just been diddling about a bit, doiing some reading on argparse this morning, and setting
up dead simple stuff in here. It downloads single youtube videos
and playlists, with no error handling or robustness at the moment,
but we are only two sessions in haha, and this isn't a super serious project
for me.

More to come soon!

6/6/2026-

Just doing some light dabbling around this morning, so far I've added support for
setting the preferred codec. This is a fun project!

